# ReXGlue SDK changes for WWE 2K14 (session56): 1ee937091702..3d91313879f7 on wwe2k14-local
# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits (first parent):
#  3d91313 wwe2k14 Session 56 review fixes (step 1f): the resolve destination offset 64-bit through NativeTruthSetDest / WbRecord (a scaled offset passes 4 GiB at 3x3: records were written 4 GiB low at the 4K preset), the readback downscale writes scaled records it reads first, the scaled materialize pipeline on its own (a failure leaves the 1x write-backs alone)
#  db10b6a wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1f: with gpu_native_truth_skip_writeback_debug_immediate, scaled texture-only resolves also on readback frames (the resolve hashes then check kNativeMaterializeScaledShader against the copy)
#  ffbbff1 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1f: scaled records compared by their guest-texel rectangle (superseded / same-texture rules as at 1x), the filled rectangle in guest texels at a scale
#  823277d wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1f fix: the scaled texture-only path reads scaled resolve textures (NativeTextureReadable / NativeTextureForRead allow_scaled; refused before: 'not readable' 32 a frame)
#  8d02f30 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1f: gpu_native_truth_skip_writeback_scaled (off) - at a resolution scale, a direct RGBA8 resolve writing its scaled texture skips its scaled resolve buffer write and is recorded; written there from the texture (kNativeMaterializeScaledShader, the inverse of the scaled resolve's DestIndex) before a scaled texture load (TextureCache::BeforeScaledResolveRead), an overlapping resolve (incl. TruthResolveScaledFull) or at its max age; such resolves are batched and renamed as at 1x; scaled records never mark the guest memory skipped
#  3a37486 wwe2k14 Session 56: diagnostic gpu_native_truth_debug_scaled_texture_only (the scaled direct resolves skip the scaled buffer write: the ceiling of texture-only resolves at a scale)
#  13f3d33 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 2b: gpu_native_truth_dedupe_state (off) - in a truth pass the index buffer bound once at offset 0 with each indexed draw from its first index, and the stencil reference / masks set only when they change
#  4b76f76 wwe2k14 Session 56: gpu_native_truth_debug_gpu_work 3 (diagnostic) - 1-pixel scissor and each draw cut to its first triangle
#  5e1a91d wwe2k14 Session 56 step 2a fix: real depth clears on any clip space (the game's clears are screen-space rectangles with clipping off); the first 12 refusals logged ([s56][clear depth])
#  59b30fe wwe2k14 Session 56 step 2a: gpu_native_truth_clear_attachments (off) - a truth fast clear writing all depth and stencil in its rectangle, whose host depth the CPU knows exactly (NativeClearDepth: its vertex shader run on the CPU, z = 0 or z = w through a plain viewport, no depth bias), is followed by vkCmdClearAttachments of the same values: a real depth clear for the GPU's hierarchical depth culling
#  acfe491 wwe2k14 Session 56 review fixes (reviewer on 1ee9370..b312b61): a retired depth bundle's framebuffers retired too (renamed depth images), a fresh image for a renamed depth slot keeps the slot's stencil tracking, the written-textures list kept only while vulkan_texture_sample_written_early is on, the deferred flush's fragment-test stages only with a renamed depth image, the twin resample pass's target made available in its closing barrier; diagnostic: the segment log says why a lazy pass needed a barrier
#  ddcc95e wwe2k14 Session 56 step 3b: gpu_native_lean_same_values (off) - a lean candidate whose render state was written still goes lean when every register written is in 0x2000-0x23FF and that range holds the base's values (bulk register writes mark whole ranges, changed or not)
#  ce5eb11 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 3a: gpu_native_lean_benign_writes (off) - SHADER_CONSTANT_FLUSH_FETCH_0..2 count as a fetch constant change, shader load packets get their own dirty bit (the lean path compares shaders), INVALIDATE_STATE counts as nothing: lean candidates no longer go to the full IssueDraw for writes that change nothing they keep
#  b312b61 wwe2k14 Session 56: diagnostic gpu_native_lean_dirty_census - which render-state registers (and state packets) send lean-path candidates to the full IssueDraw ([s56][lean dirty])
#  9f12864 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1e: gpu_native_truth_rename_depth (off) - with lazy pass dependencies, a pass that renames its colour image and opens with a fast clear writing all of the depth and stencil in its rectangle renames its depth image too (the batch flush copies the outside pixels for depth as for colour): chains of tiny clear-first passes on one depth image need no barrier between them
#  bc7a8cd wwe2k14 Session 56: gpu_native_truth_debug_lazy_ignore_depth 2 = only the scratch depth images
#  cb0ccb5 wwe2k14 Session 56: diagnostic gpu_native_truth_debug_lazy_ignore_depth (lazy passes' barrier ignores the depth image: an upper bound for giving each tiny pass its own depth image)
#  1b8d14e wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1d: vulkan_texture_sample_written_early (off) - textures written by compute or a copy are moved to the sampled layout in one barrier before a truth pass opens, not at their first sampling inside the pass (where the barrier ends the pass: ~33 scene-pass splits in Bryan's and a match frame); the deferred resolves' textures stay
#  80726bf wwe2k14 Session 56: diagnostic - with the native segment log, SubmitBarriers logs the barriers that split an open truth pass
#  cf4e2f8 wwe2k14 Session 56: diagnostic - with gpu_native_segment_log, each truth pass end logs its call stack (VulkanCommandProcessor::DebugCaptureStack; tools/perf/pass_ends.py symbolizes)
#  61a6f5b wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1c: lazy pass barriers carry the attachments' images; gpu_native_truth_lazy_pass_style (0 memory barriers, 1 image barriers of the attachments involved, 2 diagnostic without depth / stencil accesses)
#  2283c92 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1b: gpu_native_truth_lazy_pass_mode (which of the lazy passes' barriers are recorded, for measuring), vulkan_cancel_inverse_transitions (off: an image transition undoing a held one cancels it - one barrier call instead of two; census [s56][cancel])
#  ecdfac8 wwe2k14 Session 56 step 1a: gpu_native_truth_lazy_pass_deps (off) - truth passes open render passes without external subpass dependencies (each a GPU wait-for-idle: Bryan's frame 366 barrier calls + 108 passes = Nsight's 474 go-idles); the deferred command buffer records their synchronisation as barriers only where needed (CmdVkBeginRenderPassLazy / CmdVkEndRenderPassLazy: one held barrier after passes, joined with the next work's own; a barrier before a pass only after other work or on an image a pass used since). Diagnostics: vulkan_debug_barriers_nowait, gpu_native_truth_debug_pass_no_deps

